    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Musengwa Katonda yaakoba Aaroni ati: “Iwe ni batabane bo n'ab'omu kika kyo boonaboona, niimwe mwidha okuvunaanibwanga byonabyona ebinaabanga nga bisobye mu Kifo Ekitukuvu. Aye ebinaabanga nga bisobye mu bwakabona, biidha kuvunaanibwanga iwe ni batabane bo mwenka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era oidha kuleetanga baganda bo ab'ekika kya Levi, bakweyimbeku, bakuyambengaku iwe ni batabane bo, nga muli kugheereza mu Weema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baidha kukolanga emirimo gy'onaabaghanga era bakolenga n'emirimo egindi egy'omu Weema. Aye bataseetanga kumpi na bintu bikozesebwa mu Kifo Ekitukuvu, oba okuseeta ku alutaari olwo beene n'iwe mulobe kufa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baidha kukoleranga ghalala n'iwe, mu kulabiriranga Weema ey'Okwagaananirangamu ni Musengwa Katonda, nga mukola emirimo gyamu gyonagyona. Aye ghatabangagho muntu atali Mulevi, n'aseeta ye muli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era niimwe abanaalabiriranga Ekifo Ekitukuvu ni alutaari, memale olwo ndobe kwirayo kusungughalira Baisiraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era bona eno, nonze baganda bo Abalevi, naabakugha ng'ekirabo okuva mu Baisiraeli boonaboona. Bagheereibwayo eri nze Musengwa Katonda, okugheerezanga mu Weema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye iwe ni batabane bo, niimwe mwenka abanaakolanga emirimo egy'obwakabona egy'oku alutaari n'egy'omu Kifo Ekitukuvu. Mbaghaire obwakabona ng'ekirabo, era omuntu atali Mulevi bw'anaaseetanga okumpi, aidha kwitibwanga.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Musengwa Katonda yaakoba Aaroni ati: “Era bona eno, nkughaire ebyo byonabyona ebirekebwagho nga tibyokeibwa ku bigheebwayo ebitukuvu Abaisiraeli bye bampa nze Musengwa Katonda. Mbikughaire iwe ni batabane bo ng'omugabo gwe munaafunanga ebyanda n'ebyanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bino n'ebinaabanga ebyaimwe ku bintu ebitukuvu einho byonabyona ebigheebwayo eri nze Musengwa Katonda, ebirekebwagho nga tibyokeibwa: buli ekigheebwayo eky'emere ey'empeke, buli ekigheebwayo olw'ebibi, na buli ekigheebwayo ng'omutango. Byonabyona ebitukuvu einho ebigheebwayo eri nze Musengwa Katonda, biidha kubanga bibyo ni batabane bo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebintu ebyo mwidha kubiriiranga mu Kifo Ekitukuvu Einho, era buli musaadha anaabanga wa idembe okubiryaku. Mubitwalenga nga bitukuvu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Okwongereza ku ebyo, ebintu ebindi byonabyona Abaisiraeli bye banaaghangayo eri nze Musengwa Katonda ng'ekigheebwayo eky'endhawulo nga kiwuubibwa, biidha kubanga bibyo iwe, ni batane bo, ni baghala bo ng'omugabo gwe munaafunanga ebyanda n'ebyanda. Buli muntu yeenayeena ow'omu ndhu yo anaabanga wa idembe okubiryaku kasita anaabanga nga mulongoofu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nkughaire ebirime ebisinga bulungi ebisooka okukungulwa Abaisiraeli bye bampa, era nga ni bino: omuzigo ogw'ebibala eby'emiti emyoliva, omwenge ogw'emizabbibu n'emere ey'empeke. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era nkughaire ebibala ebisooka okwenga mu misiri gyaibwe gyonagyona bye bandeetera nze Musengwa Katonda. Buli muntu yeenayeena ow'omu ndhu yo nga mulongoofu, anaabanga wa idembe okubiryaku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Buli kintu kyonakyona ekinaagheebwangayo mu Isiraeli okuba ekyange, kiidha kubanga kikyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
