              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lev 27:28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Buli kintu kyonakyona ekinaazaalibwanga mu luzaalo olusooka ekigheebwayo eri nze Musengwa Katonda, k'abe omuntu oba k'ebe ensolo, kiidha kubanga kikyo. Aye oidha kuganhanga okutwala ekyo ekinaagheebwangayo okununula omwana omuberi, n'ekyo ekinaagheebwangayo okununula ensolo ezaalibwa mu luzaalo olusooka etali nongoofu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaana banaanunulwanga nga ba mwezi mulala, era buli mwana aidha kusasulirwanga ebitundu bitaanu ebya feeza, ng'ojiira ku mbala entongole ey'eisinzizo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye ente n'entaama n'embuzi edhinaazaalibwanga mu luzaalo olusooka, tibaadhinunulenga. Edho dhange ku bwange, kale ntukuvu. Oidha kudhiitanga, omansirenga omusaayi gwadho ku alutaari, era oyokyenga amasavu gaadho ng'ekigheebwayo ekyokebwa. Akawoowo kaadho kansangaaza nze Musengwa Katonda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emamba yaadho eidha kubanga yiyo, mu nsambo n'endala ng'ekifuba ekigheebwayo eri nze Musengwa Katonda nga kiwuubibwa n'ekisambi eky'oku luuyi olw'omukono omusaadha, bwe biri ebibyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkughaire iwe, ni batabane bo, ni baghala bo, ebigheebwayo ebitukuvu byonabyona Abaisiraeli bye banandeeteranga nze Musengwa Katonda, bibe omugabo gwaimwe gwe munaafunanga ebyanda n'ebyanda. Eyo n'endagaano ye nkoze n'iwe era n'eizaire lyo, etaja kumenhebwagho ebyanda n'ebyanda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era Musengwa Katonda yaakoba Aaroni ati: “Timwidha kufuna kintu kyonakyona kya nsikirano, waire okugheebwa omugabo gwonagwona mu nsi y'Abaisiraeli. Ninze omugabo gwaimwe ogunaababeesangagho mu Baisiraeli.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era Musengwa Katonda yaakoba ati: “Abalevi mbaghaire ekintu kirala kirala ku buli bintu eikumi Abaisiraeli kye bampa, gube omugabo gwaibwe olw'okusasulira obugheereza bwe bakola mu Weema ey'Okwagaananirangamu ni Musengwa Katonda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.27.30+LEV.27.31+LEV.27.32+LEV.27.33"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lev 27:30-33",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.14.22+DEU.14.23+DEU.14.24+DEU.14.25+DEU.14.26+DEU.14.27+DEU.14.28+DEU.14.29"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ma 14:22-29",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okuva ni mpegaano, Abaisiraeli abandi abatali Balevi bataseetanga kumpi na Weema eyo, olwo balobe kwereetaku kibi kya kubaitisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye Abalevi bonka n'abanaagheerezanga mu Weema eyo, era n'abanaavunaanizibwanga ebisobu ebinaagibangamu. Eiteeka eryo liidha kubangagho mu nse dhoonadhoona edhiriiragho. Abalevi tibaidha kugheebwanga mugabo mu Baisiraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olw'okuba mpaire Abalevi ekintu kirala kirala ku buli bintu ikumi Abaisiraeli kye bampa, gube omugabo gwaibwe, kye nviire ni nkoba nti tibaidha kugheebwanga mugabo mu Baisiraeli.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Musengwa Katonda yaakoba Musa ati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Koba abalevi oti, ‘Bwe munaamalanga okutoola ku Baisiraeli ekintu ekirala ekirala ku buli bintu eikumi kye bampa, nze Musengwa kye mbaghaire ng'omugabo gwaimwe, mwena mwidha kutoolanga ekintu kirala kirala ku buli bintu ikumi ku ebyo bye mufunie, kibenga ekigheebwayo eri nze Musengwa Katonda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekigheebwayo kyaimwe ekyo kiidha kutwalibwanga ng'oti n'ekigheebwayo eky'emere ey'empeke eva mu kifo aghakubirwa engaano, era ng'oti n'ekigheebwayo ekiidhuvu ekiva mu kikunhiro eky'omwenge ogw'emizabbibu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale mutyo mwena bwe mwidhanga okutoola ekintu ekirala ekirala ku buli bintu eikumi Abaisiraeli boonaboona bye banaabaghanga, mukigheeyo ng'ekigheebwayo eri nze Musengwa Katonda. Ekigheebwayo kyaimwe ekyo mwidha kukighanga Aaroni kabona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku bintu byonabyona bye munaafunanga, mwidha kutoolangaku ebisinga bulungi mubighengayo mu bwidhuvu ng'ekigheebwayo eri nze Musengwa Katonda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwe munaamalanga okughaayo ebyo ebisinga bulungi, ebisigalagho mwidha kubisigazanga ng'omuntu bw'asigaza ebiva mu kifo aghakubirwa engaano n'ebiva mu kikunhiro eky'omwenge ogw'emizabbibu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munaabanga ba idembe, imwe beene era n'ab'omu ndhu dhaimwe, okubiriira mu kifo kyonakyona ekibaagho, kuba ebyo n'ebisasulira obugheereza bwe mukola mu Weema ey'Okwagaananirangamu ni Musengwa Katonda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era timuubenga na kibi kye mukoze olw'okubirya, kasita munaabanga nga mughaireyo ebisinga bulungi. Aye mwegenderezenga mulobe kwonoona ebintu ebitukuvu Abaisiraeli bye baleeta, memale olwo mulobe kufa.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
